            <ArticleTitle>[Evaluation of the efficacy of paracetamol as a component of postoperative combined analgesia in children].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>58-62</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative pain is one of the most serious problems in patients who have undergone surgical interventions. The paper analyzes the efficiency of various postoperative analgesia regimens in children and shows the high efficiency of paracetamol as a component of combined anesthesia in the postoperative period.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
